      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 46,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "When the prince enters, he shall go in by the way of the porch of the gate, and he shall go out by its way.",
      "ko": "왕이 올 때에는 이 문 현관을 통하여 들어오고 나갈 때에도 그리할찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "555555831be2fd2fc72009eaa5535578a9edd78a4e402d41c2307c0191db03a2",
      "translation_text_hash": "a2fcb75db3d8e9b68b828f3a9f560dcd299468f3307dc0f043bb1633c5b189ae",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
