      "en": "Then he brought me out into the outer court and caused me to pass by the four corners of the court; and behold, in every corner of the court there was a court.",
      "ko": "나를 데리고 바깥 뜰로 나가서 나로 뜰 네 구석을 지나가게 하시는데 본즉 그 뜰 매 구석에 또 뜰이 있는데",
      "source_text_hash": "74c7aba8062fcb64349be32f72d79ab818910a1ab7aed08911eb4b2b4491b9bd",
      "translation_text_hash": "f9be1581a4ab3d21bd7118441ef22a66c35a33cf51a4f5375dbfadd726ad90cb",
